<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41063" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστονᾰχ-στόρνῡμι</span></b> : fut.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-στρώσω</span>: aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εστόρεσα</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστρωσα</span>: aor.
		
			Med.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εστορέσαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					24.334
				</span></i>
			:—<i>strew</i> or <i>spread upon</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐστόρεσεν δ᾽ ἐπὶ δέρμα</span>
			<i>upon</i> the bed, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				14.50
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱμάτιον ἐπὶ τὸ ξύλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					75
				</span></i>
			; a barbarous fut., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστρωννύσω</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ γῇ νιφετόν</span>, only in Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Philopatr.</u>
				24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>.
			<i>saddle</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστρῶσαι</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ὄνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					8.9.1
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ κάμηλος] ἁλουργίδι ἐπέστρωτο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Prom.Es</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
